Subject: IR3 Fixture Source Unsupported Scope Refusal
Date: 2026-05-26

& [IR3FixtureSource: unsupported_scope_refusal] is an operator harness fixture source
  + [fixture_case] is unsupported_scope_refusal
  + [requested_operator_id] is contract_driven_operator_runner
  + [requested_operator_version] is v1
  + [requested_scope] is outside_current_activation_boundary
  + [refusal_allowed] is true

